1
00:00:34,517 --> 00:00:36,347
Thank you, Vince.

2
00:00:43,777 --> 00:00:47,407
<i>Pursued from Romdeau by a monster called PROXY,</i>

3
00:00:48,027 --> 00:00:50,867
<i>I managed to escape to the outside world.</i>

4
00:00:55,787 --> 00:01:01,497
<i>After losing everything, only doubt and a single choice remain.</i>

5
00:01:02,297 --> 00:01:06,047
<i>If I go to Mosk, my homeland,</i>

6
00:01:06,047 --> 00:01:08,337
<i>I might be able to figure something out.</i>

7
00:01:09,507 --> 00:01:11,467
<i>The journey thus began,</i>

8
00:01:12,467 --> 00:01:13,767
<i>and several days have passed...</i>

9
00:01:15,387 --> 00:01:18,517
<i>It's not just our bodies that have weakened.</i>

10
00:01:19,857 --> 00:01:22,517
<i>The overcast sky stretches endlessly above.</i>

11
00:01:23,317 --> 00:01:26,277
<i>The frozen ground stretches endlessly below.</i>

12
00:01:26,947 --> 00:01:30,407
<i>Threatening to chill us to the depths of our souls,</i>

13
00:01:30,907 --> 00:01:32,657
<i>the view haunts us.</i>

