2134
00:04:09,687 --> 00:04:11,607
This ability to heal...

2135
00:04:12,277 --> 00:04:14,857
You surprise me every time,

2136
00:04:15,277 --> 00:04:16,277
Re-l...

2137
00:04:19,407 --> 00:04:23,327
meditation    re-l 124C41+

2138
00:04:22,077 --> 00:04:23,367
Chairman Daedalus.

2139
00:04:38,967 --> 00:04:43,717
PROXY has already disappeared from Romdeau's vicinity.

2140
00:04:43,717 --> 00:04:46,097
