2141
00:04:47,727 --> 00:04:52,227
If you have any specific information, please disclose-

2142
00:04:52,227 --> 00:04:52,977
Do not forget.

2143
00:04:54,107 --> 00:04:58,277
While we are individuals, we are also a collective.

2144
00:04:58,567 --> 00:05:02,777
If the Research Bureau knows how to track PROXY,

2145
00:05:03,657 --> 00:05:05,077
then the Security Bureau's position-

2146
00:05:05,077 --> 00:05:07,367
Quarrels between the bureaus are of-

2147
00:05:07,657 --> 00:05:09,877
What we sense,

2148
00:05:11,077 --> 00:05:15,877
in other words, is that we are capable
 of knowing everything about Romdeau.

2149
00:05:16,667 --> 00:05:24,307
We are able to verify PROXY's presence just by connecting.

2150
00:05:25,057 --> 00:05:28,057
PROXY does not "exist" in Romdeau.

2151
00:05:28,597 --> 00:05:31,017
That is the only truth.

2152
00:05:31,647 --> 00:05:35,317
Then this individual would like to pose a question to the collective.

2153
00:05:36,147 --> 00:05:39,987
What is the significance of we citizens
 allowing someone to return from the outside world,

2154
00:05:39,987 --> 00:05:43,827
when we have always refused to do so?

2155
00:05:44,117 --> 00:05:49,867
You do not have the right to
 request disclosure of that information.

2156
00:05:50,167 --> 00:05:51,617
It is time.

2157
00:06:33,207 --> 00:06:35,287
<i>Knowing the truth</i>

2158
00:06:35,587 --> 00:06:37,797
<i>does not necessarily bring happiness.</i>

2159
00:06:39,207 --> 00:06:42,297
<i>Actually accepting such an obvious fact of life...</i>

2160
00:06:42,297 --> 00:06:44,297
<i>takes such a long time.</i>

2161
00:06:45,387 --> 00:06:48,467
<i>I've become painfully aware that it is my weakness.</i>

2162
00:06:52,687 --> 00:06:54,517
<i>Grandfather's lie...</i>

2163
00:06:56,857 --> 00:06:59,567
<i>A world exists outside this city.</i>

2164
00:07:00,987 --> 00:07:04,107
<i>There, people lead their own lives.</i>

2165
00:07:07,157 --> 00:07:09,287
<i>I've become aware of this fact.</i>

2166
00:07:09,987 --> 00:07:10,867
<i>That is why...</i>

2167
00:07:12,287 --> 00:07:15,117
<i>I must not flee from this reality.</i>

2168
00:07:28,427 --> 00:07:29,717
<i>Why is that here?</i>

2169
00:07:30,717 --> 00:07:32,057
<i>Daedalus,</i>

2170
00:07:32,057 --> 00:07:33,477
<i>as I'd suspected, you...</i>

2171
00:08:39,077 --> 00:08:41,127
This is the artificial womb.

2172
00:08:44,087 --> 00:08:45,337
Daedalus!

2173
00:08:46,007 --> 00:08:50,427
This is where all Romdeau citizens are born: the Womb Room.

2174
00:08:50,927 --> 00:08:52,347
Daedalus...

2175
00:08:52,347 --> 00:08:53,427
Why?

2176
00:08:54,257 --> 00:08:56,727
I must insist that you return the tools of my trade.

2177
00:08:57,387 --> 00:09:01,477
If even one of these is missing, I won't be able to cover for you.

2178
00:09:02,557 --> 00:09:05,437
Well, I must compliment you on your curiosity.

2179
00:09:10,527 --> 00:09:11,817
Come with me.

2180
00:09:12,447 --> 00:09:13,827
I'll show this to you.

2181
00:09:15,617 --> 00:09:21,037
Biologically, and from a structural
 standpoint, this life maintenance system

2182
00:09:21,617 --> 00:09:23,997
is the most efficient production line possible for the dome.

2183
00:09:24,787 --> 00:09:30,127
Here, we are born to become model
 citizens and be raised by model citizens.

2184
00:09:33,007 --> 00:09:35,387
Everything is managed and restricted;

2185
00:09:35,387 --> 00:09:37,217
the balance is maintained.

2186
00:09:38,387 --> 00:09:41,557
In order to live in an environment such as the dome,

2187
00:09:41,557 --> 00:09:45,357
managing and stabilizing the population is, after all, critical.

2188
00:09:47,017 --> 00:09:47,897
Re-l?

2189
00:09:48,357 --> 00:09:49,527
I'm fine.

2190
00:09:50,147 --> 00:09:56,237
So the creation of humans, like
 autoreivs, is controlled by a production line?

2191
00:09:56,237 --> 00:09:57,447
Still,

2192
00:09:57,447 --> 00:09:59,497
although I can understand that on an intellectual level...

2193
00:09:59,907 --> 00:10:01,997
It's a different matter entirely when you actually see it?

2194
00:10:05,077 --> 00:10:08,377
Manipulative intrusions into life processes...

2195
00:10:08,957 --> 00:10:13,677
By continuing to do so, we are prolonging the human race.

2196
00:10:14,887 --> 00:10:16,507
This is reality...?

2197
00:10:16,847 --> 00:10:21,057
If so, what was the outside world I saw?

2198
00:10:21,677 --> 00:10:24,347
Daedalus, tell me.

2199
00:10:24,347 --> 00:10:29,527
Is this dome actually necessary as a system for model citizens?

2200
00:10:30,277 --> 00:10:32,397
If an outside world truly exists,

2201
00:10:32,737 --> 00:10:35,237
hasn't the system outlived its usefulness already?

2202
00:10:36,447 --> 00:10:38,077
I am an idiot...

2203
00:10:38,697 --> 00:10:41,827
I almost lost someone dear to me.

2204
00:10:44,327 --> 00:10:45,327
I...

2205
00:10:45,997 --> 00:10:48,537
should not have let you go outside.

2206
00:10:48,837 --> 00:10:50,547
It's too late now.

2207
00:10:51,207 --> 00:10:53,917
I can't run from the truth that I've come to know.

2208
00:10:54,257 --> 00:10:55,217
Indeed.

2209
00:10:55,677 --> 00:10:57,137
The promise...

2210
00:10:57,137 --> 00:10:58,467
Do you remember it?

2211
00:10:59,297 --> 00:11:00,217
Yes.

2212
00:11:00,807 --> 00:11:04,637
But could you at least let me save some face first?

2213
00:11:06,557 --> 00:11:08,687
You want me to go see Grandfather?

2214
00:11:10,897 --> 00:11:12,397
<i>He's right.</i>

2215
00:11:12,897 --> 00:11:15,357
<i>Before I depart on a journey for truth,</i>

2216
00:11:16,817 --> 00:11:19,157
<i>there is someone I must face.</i>

2217
00:11:25,117 --> 00:11:27,497
<i>A world in which there is neither presence of man</i>

2218
00:11:27,497 --> 00:11:30,337
<i>nor any trace of life.</i>

2219
00:11:35,127 --> 00:11:37,257
<i>Mosk supposedly lies...</i>

2220
00:11:37,967 --> 00:11:39,797
<i>a great distance beyond it.</i>

2221
00:11:44,217 --> 00:11:45,347
<i>And...</i>

2222
00:11:47,017 --> 00:11:49,647
<i>exhaustion marks every face.</i>

2223
00:12:00,617 --> 00:12:02,117
Grandfather,

2224
00:12:02,117 --> 00:12:04,197
I am sorry to have caused you worry.

2225
00:12:07,117 --> 00:12:08,417
Re-l,

2226
00:12:08,417 --> 00:12:10,327
are you satisfied?

2227
00:12:10,327 --> 00:12:13,127
What did you see in the outside world?

2228
00:12:13,627 --> 00:12:15,837
Feel free to tell us without hesitation.

2229
00:12:17,797 --> 00:12:20,967
Have you lost the ability of speech?

2230
00:12:21,637 --> 00:12:23,387
There were people.

2231
00:12:23,847 --> 00:12:25,467
There was a livelihood.

2232
00:12:26,217 --> 00:12:27,887
There was a world.

2233
00:12:28,427 --> 00:12:29,477
I see.

2234
00:12:30,937 --> 00:12:33,227
Why do you hide this?

2235
00:12:33,227 --> 00:12:34,107
Re-l.

2236
00:12:34,107 --> 00:12:36,317
What are you afraid of?

2237
00:12:36,317 --> 00:12:37,647
You go too far-

2238
00:12:37,647 --> 00:12:39,777
I am speaking with my grandfather.

2239
00:12:45,987 --> 00:12:48,497
<i>No answers, I see.</i>

2240
00:12:56,377 --> 00:12:58,127
<i>I wonder how long it's been</i>

2241
00:12:59,087 --> 00:13:01,677
<i>since we left Romdeau behind.</i>

2242
00:13:03,967 --> 00:13:05,967
<i>His face shows signs of exhaustion.</i>

2243
00:13:07,637 --> 00:13:08,677
<i>And...</i>

2244
00:13:09,887 --> 00:13:11,267
<i>yet another falls...</i>

2245
00:13:41,877 --> 00:13:42,967
Re-l.

2246
00:13:52,937 --> 00:13:54,227
Re-l.

2247
00:13:54,227 --> 00:13:55,517
Re-l!

2248
00:13:56,187 --> 00:13:57,977
His decisions were deemed inappropriate,

2249
00:13:57,977 --> 00:14:00,227
so he'd been sent off for readjustment.

2250
00:14:00,857 --> 00:14:03,357
I decided to take him in.

2251
00:14:04,147 --> 00:14:05,657
I'll go make some preparations.

2252
00:14:12,537 --> 00:14:14,327
If Prince Charming hadn't been around,

2253
00:14:14,327 --> 00:14:16,167
I'd be scrap metal by now.

2254
00:14:16,787 --> 00:14:18,417
Did you lose some weight?

2255
00:14:18,417 --> 00:14:20,337
You look pale, too.

2256
00:14:21,337 --> 00:14:24,047
You can't do without me, can you?

2257
00:14:25,627 --> 00:14:26,927
Hey, Re-l.

2258
00:14:26,927 --> 00:14:28,467
What's with the cold shoulder?

2259
00:14:29,297 --> 00:14:32,057
<i>Because you... are still...</i>

2260
00:14:32,677 --> 00:14:33,727
Well then.

2261
00:14:34,727 --> 00:14:37,897
Now it's time for me to fulfill my promise.

2262
00:14:37,897 --> 00:14:38,897
Wait.

2263
00:14:38,897 --> 00:14:40,067
Before that...

2264
00:14:45,527 --> 00:14:46,737
Ah,

2265
00:14:46,737 --> 00:14:48,817
I haven't told you yet, have I.

2266
00:14:48,817 --> 00:14:52,577
I made the same modifications to Iggy as my assistants.

2267
00:14:53,657 --> 00:14:56,577
You disconnected their link to the surveillance structure.

2268
00:14:57,117 --> 00:14:57,997
That's right.

2269
00:14:58,327 --> 00:15:02,707
In effect, Iggy's "ears" are no longer your grandfather's.

2270
00:15:03,547 --> 00:15:06,417
Now I can badmouth the Security Bureau.

2271
00:15:07,877 --> 00:15:08,887
Well then.

2272
00:15:09,387 --> 00:15:11,047
On to the main topic:

2273
00:15:12,347 --> 00:15:18,347
the autopsy results of the life form
 you reported as being brutally killed

2274
00:15:18,347 --> 00:15:20,607
in the deepest area of the outer shell...

2275
00:15:21,937 --> 00:15:23,267
But before that,

2276
00:15:24,477 --> 00:15:27,447
let me tell you everything I know from the very beginning.

2277
00:15:35,697 --> 00:15:37,867
An era is ending.

2278
00:15:38,367 --> 00:15:39,417
Chief?

2279
00:15:40,167 --> 00:15:42,837
The Administrator's decline in health

2280
00:15:42,837 --> 00:15:45,707
is, while gradual, beginning.

2281
00:15:46,837 --> 00:15:50,257
The paleness of his face is proof beyond all doubt.

2282
00:15:50,637 --> 00:15:55,257
Such statements are recorded by
 Entourage-type autoreivs such as myself.

2283
00:15:55,257 --> 00:15:57,017
I want you to hear them.

2284
00:16:00,017 --> 00:16:02,097
Have you found any trace of PROXY?

2285
00:16:02,097 --> 00:16:04,187
Since it is no longer within the city limits,

2286
00:16:04,187 --> 00:16:08,277
it would be difficult to conduct a remote
 pursuit investigation using existing systems.

2287
00:16:10,197 --> 00:16:11,817
Let's take a simple approach.

2288
00:16:12,277 --> 00:16:15,367
We'll use a relic that's been hidden in the underground facility.

2289
00:16:15,827 --> 00:16:18,247
Confirmed information release mode.

2290
00:16:18,907 --> 00:16:19,617
Oh?

2291
00:16:19,997 --> 00:16:22,747
You are referring to the ultra-long-distance transportation device

2292
00:16:22,747 --> 00:16:24,497
that was used during the Mosk invasion operation, correct?

2293
00:16:24,497 --> 00:16:27,047
"In for a penny, in for a pound."

2294
00:16:27,757 --> 00:16:30,587
I'll teach you the meaning of this phrase.

2295
00:16:32,467 --> 00:16:38,137
<u>Note:</u> Monad, a symbol of God or totality, comes from the Greek
  word Î¼Î¿Î½Î¬Ï which means "one", "single", or "unique".

2296
00:16:32,467 --> 00:16:36,467
We had been calling it the Monad PROXY.

2297
00:16:37,097 --> 00:16:38,137
"Monad"?

2298
00:16:38,847 --> 00:16:44,397
And we seized it from the Mosk dome by force.

2299
00:16:50,237 --> 00:16:54,697
When I was assigned to this facility, it already existed.

2300
00:16:55,907 --> 00:16:58,287
Why it was kept enclosed here

2301
00:16:58,287 --> 00:17:00,827
and why we were not allowed to let it awaken...

2302
00:17:01,497 --> 00:17:04,367
I myself do not know the real reasons for that.

2303
00:17:05,627 --> 00:17:07,917
However, I do know some things.

2304
00:17:09,417 --> 00:17:11,877
First, it is not human

2305
00:17:12,757 --> 00:17:16,347
from both a theological and a biological standpoint.

2306
00:17:17,007 --> 00:17:19,847
Secondly, we also could not verify that it had a gender.

2307
00:17:20,427 --> 00:17:23,387
It is my belief that to Romdeau city,

2308
00:17:23,387 --> 00:17:27,357
PROXY is an entity that could be construed as a life force.

2309
00:17:28,607 --> 00:17:31,227
So rather than a monster, it's...

2310
00:17:31,567 --> 00:17:32,437
Yes.

2311
00:17:32,937 --> 00:17:35,237
It certainly <i>seems</i> to be an entity like God.

2312
00:17:37,027 --> 00:17:39,117
One could even say

2313
00:17:39,117 --> 00:17:43,657
that it is a key to maintaining the field
 we need to survive in this desolate world.

2314
00:17:45,787 --> 00:17:47,827
Sounds like something from the occult.

2315
00:17:47,827 --> 00:17:51,337
But the data has appeared in reality as well.

2316
00:17:51,627 --> 00:17:53,377
In addition, look.

2317
00:17:53,757 --> 00:17:57,887
The cells that constitute the subject
 are immortal cells called amrita cells.

2318
00:17:59,347 --> 00:18:01,767
If we can discover their secret,

2319
00:18:02,387 --> 00:18:03,597
we...

2320
00:18:04,517 --> 00:18:07,557
An entity that could be the key to human survival...

2321
00:18:07,557 --> 00:18:09,227
That is PROXY.

2322
00:18:10,357 --> 00:18:12,897
But even that has been lost.

2323
00:18:14,237 --> 00:18:16,277
Then that means Romdeau is...

2324
00:18:16,567 --> 00:18:17,487
Yes.

2325
00:18:17,987 --> 00:18:19,657
But we must not forget

2326
00:18:20,277 --> 00:18:22,697
the secret only the two of us know.

2327
00:18:23,907 --> 00:18:26,117
There is more than one PROXY.

2328
00:18:26,117 --> 00:18:27,787
Well done.

2329
00:18:28,417 --> 00:18:30,587
I think you just insulted me.

2330
00:18:30,587 --> 00:18:31,587
Now then,

2331
00:18:32,087 --> 00:18:34,377
I have one thing I'd like to ask you as well.

2332
00:18:35,837 --> 00:18:39,677
Where did you learn the word, "PROXY"?

2333
00:18:41,797 --> 00:18:43,967
Your fault for leaving your seat.

2334
00:18:44,307 --> 00:18:45,267
Re-l...

2335
00:18:46,267 --> 00:18:51,307
To tell you the truth, I don't know why I'm so drawn to it.

2336
00:18:52,227 --> 00:18:54,187
An empathetic encounter?

2337
00:18:54,187 --> 00:18:55,687
That's not all.

2338
00:18:56,607 --> 00:18:59,657
When I saw it, something changed.

2339
00:19:06,287 --> 00:19:10,327
Until now, my life required neither doubts nor answers.

2340
00:19:11,577 --> 00:19:14,707
All I had to do was to carry out the tasks assigned to me.

2341
00:19:16,047 --> 00:19:18,797
Even now, I may still be able to go back to that life.

2342
00:19:18,797 --> 00:19:19,797
But...

2343
00:19:20,337 --> 00:19:21,337
"But"?

2344
00:19:22,297 --> 00:19:23,757
But I have encountered <i>it</i>.

2345
00:19:23,757 --> 00:19:27,347
And I have seen the outside world.

2346
00:19:28,597 --> 00:19:32,397
I can't turn away from the facts after they've been uncovered.

2347
00:19:32,857 --> 00:19:34,187
I must admit

2348
00:19:34,687 --> 00:19:36,067
it's just like you to say that.

2349
00:19:37,487 --> 00:19:39,897
Still, I am the same way.

2350
00:19:40,357 --> 00:19:41,947
I want to know the answers.

2351
00:19:42,527 --> 00:19:44,067
That is why I'm here.

2352
00:19:45,117 --> 00:19:46,367
Daedalus.

2353
00:20:02,757 --> 00:20:04,847
<i>It's just the two of us now.</i>

2354
00:20:05,887 --> 00:20:06,927
<i>No...</i>

2355
00:20:07,677 --> 00:20:09,477
<i>She is an autoreiv.</i>

2356
00:20:14,857 --> 00:20:17,227
<i>I am alone again.</i>

2357
00:20:19,187 --> 00:20:20,397
Let's go.

2358
00:20:20,397 --> 00:20:22,947
It's where Vince was born, right?

2359
00:20:23,947 --> 00:20:24,987
Yeah...

2360
00:20:29,577 --> 00:20:31,287
What kind of place is it?

2361
00:20:31,287 --> 00:20:32,577
Well, it's...

2362
00:20:33,537 --> 00:20:35,787
Well, you'll know once you get there.

2363
00:20:37,247 --> 00:20:38,047
Re-l!

2364
00:20:46,887 --> 00:20:48,097
Iggy!

2365
00:20:53,937 --> 00:20:55,227
We're within the facility!

2366
00:20:55,687 --> 00:20:57,307
How is this possible?!

2367
00:21:01,897 --> 00:21:02,937
Chairman.

2368
00:21:04,027 --> 00:21:05,357
It's infected?

2369
00:21:06,027 --> 00:21:07,277
By cogito...

2370
00:21:40,017 --> 00:21:40,977
Impossible...

2371
00:21:42,277 --> 00:21:45,107
They made the cogito virus into a weapon?

2372
00:21:48,487 --> 00:21:50,197
I'm their target.

2373
00:21:50,527 --> 00:21:51,577
Raul...

2374
00:21:51,577 --> 00:21:54,197
The virus' infection mechanism isn't even known, yet...

2375
00:21:54,827 --> 00:21:58,167
It means he's willing to go far in order to monopolize it.

2376
00:21:58,617 --> 00:22:00,457
He wants to know where PROXY has gone?

2377
00:22:06,047 --> 00:22:08,257
The man who knows that answer...

2378
00:22:09,177 --> 00:22:10,547
is Vincent Law.

2379
00:22:12,557 --> 00:22:13,637
Re-l,

2380
00:22:13,637 --> 00:22:16,637
I got a response from a tap I set up in the Security Bureau.

2381
00:22:17,097 --> 00:22:19,227
Beginning trace of target.

2382
00:22:19,977 --> 00:22:20,687
Re-l!

2383
00:22:34,197 --> 00:22:35,537
Re-l!!!

2384
00:22:45,377 --> 00:22:47,047
<i>All alone...</i>

2385
00:22:48,297 --> 00:22:51,047
<i>What the last remaining human obtained</i>

2386
00:22:51,637 --> 00:22:54,467
<i>was simply time to think...</i>

2387
00:22:55,927 --> 00:22:59,347
<i>Memories I'm trying to forget yet cannot recall.</i>

2388
00:23:00,517 --> 00:23:04,977
<i>There's some sort of hard lump in my head.</i>

2389
00:23:05,517 --> 00:23:06,977
<i>Just what that is...</i>

2390
00:23:07,647 --> 00:23:10,237
<i>What is within me...</i>

2391
00:23:13,817 --> 00:23:16,117
<i>Even if I were to know what they are,</i>

2392
00:23:16,867 --> 00:23:18,577
<i>what good would that do me now?</i>

2393
00:23:19,327 --> 00:23:20,577
<i>Now,</i>

2394
00:23:21,537 --> 00:23:23,997
<i>when I'm all alone...</i>

2395
00:23:25,667 --> 00:23:28,257
<i>I will never see her again.</i>

2396
00:23:29,047 --> 00:23:30,167
<i>That's why...</i>

2397
00:23:30,167 --> 00:23:32,047
<i>I must forget her, but...</i>

2398
00:23:34,177 --> 00:23:37,007
<i>I can't forget that face.</i>

